\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Membership calibration against three control fields at matched Galactic latitude, processed through the identical selection, clustering and membership model. \emph  {Left:} membership-probability distributions on identical axes. \emph  {Centre:} external-list recovery and the mean control-to-target yield as the catalogue threshold changes; the dashed line is the adopted maximum- posterior boundary. \emph  {Right:} the numbers of clean automatic sources above $P>0.5$ in the association and control fields. The control fields calibrated the mixture prior, so their yield measures internal consistency rather than a fully independent contamination rate.}}{7}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
